Z||000000||V8Fiero||07-02-2001||06:51 PM||||Just curious if anyone has used a factory delco cd player in their fiero? I checked with my Pontiac dealer. Turned out just like I thought. Nothing. But then they only punch numbers.<P>Was curious if say a Firebird or Camaro CD player would work?<P><BR>Thanks.<BR>Scott||||reg||5
Z||000001||Leadfoot||07-02-2001||07:00 PM||||Do a search for delco radios.  There was a site that sold the factory units.  On of the company reps. said the older radios will work with some minor mount modifications.  I just didn't think it was work it for those prices.||||reg||1
Z||000002||V8Fiero||07-02-2001||07:10 PM||||Man I love this place (forum). I did a search on CD and came up with what I was looking for. <P>Thanks.<BR>Scott <P>Now if someone would make me an offer on my Alpine receiver and changer that is for sale in the mall.<p>[This message has been edited by V8Fiero (edited 07-02-2001).]||||reg||14
